        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Paper, wood-containing, supercalendred (SC), at regional storage
na;
UUID: 914484be-6a4f-3fbf-b148-c1ab592f7a21
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site within Switzerland for the domestic and the foreign SC paper consumed in Switzerland.; Geography: Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Location:  Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total Swiss graphic paper consumption 2000: 725.8 kt (official statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, imports from neighbourhood countries and imports from scandinavian countries.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_914484be-6a4f-3fbf-b148-c1ab592f7a21.xml</text>
